diff --git a/docs/CHANGELOG.md b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
index 549dee1..6b08dbe 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -15,6 +15,12 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Keep Blade caller types consistent.** Component-bound variables honor source PHPDoc, and cross-file view data inference stays independent of another file’s diagnostic scope. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
+- **Show direct anonymous invocations and file callers.** Call hierarchy follows literal immediately invoked closures and arrows, and preserves known calls made at file scope. Creating a first-class callable remains a reference rather than an invocation; other callback and file-entry callers stay unknown. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
+- **Keep anonymous callers in PHP call hierarchies.** Literal known calls inside closures and arrow functions retain their own caller nodes, with exact source navigation and stale-item refusal. Anonymous value-flow invocation callers remain unknown. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Refresh global PHP profiles automatically.** Changing the global PHP version or extension selection updates completion and diagnostics while preserving unsaved files. Closing the service also cancels pending client requests safely. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Retire diagnostics before replacing project services.** Previously accepted diagnostic sends finish queuing before project retirement, preventing old service publications from crossing the replacement boundary. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
